NOTE ON DATA LICENSING (code vs. data are licensed separately):

This MIT license covers the CODE in this repository only. Third-party data and
model scores carry their own licenses and must be attributed to their sources.

An earlier version of this note named AlphaMissense as the non-commercial column
and left six tools as "per each tool's own license" without resolving them. That
was incomplete: FIVE of the ten predictor columns are restricted to
non-commercial use. Each is resolved individually below.


FUNCTIONAL MEASUREMENTS (MaveDB deposits)

  CC0 1.0
    BRCA1   urn:mavedb:00000097-0-2
    BRCA2   urn:mavedb:00001225-a-1
    BARD1   urn:mavedb:00001250-a-2
    PALB2   urn:mavedb:00001259-a-2

  CC BY 4.0 (attribution to the originating publication required)
    RAD51C  urn:mavedb:00000673-0-1
    VHL     urn:mavedb:00000675-a-1
    BAP1    urn:mavedb:00000662-0-1

  The per-deposit table with transcripts and references is in README.md.


PREDICTOR SCORE COLUMNS — five of ten are non-commercial

  NON-COMMERCIAL:
    AlphaGenome             non-commercial use only (API free tier)
    SpliceAI                CC BY-NC 4.0 for the trained models; other use
                            requires a commercial licence from Illumina
    CADD                    non-commercial; commercial use requires a licence
                            from the University of Washington
    AlphaMissense           CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — non-commercial AND share-alike
    Nucleotide Transformer  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — non-commercial AND share-alike

  ATTRIBUTION AT MOST:
    GPN-MSA                 MIT
    phyloP-100way           UCSC track data, free for public and commercial use
    phastCons-100way        UCSC track data, free for public and commercial use
    gnomAD allele freq.     CC0 1.0 (attribution requested, not required)

  PANGOLIN — a separate case, stated rather than omitted:
    The program is licensed GPL-3.0. Running a GPL-licensed program does not
    place its output under the GPL, so the pangolin_score column is recorded as
    unencumbered by that licence. This is an explicit determination, not an
    oversight.

  Per-column determinations, each with the URL it was read from, are published
  as results/predictor_resources_v1.tsv (columns `licence`, `licence_source`) in
  the companion atlas deposit, concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21828448.


OTHER SOURCES

  ClinVar (NCBI): public domain.
  gnomAD (Broad Institute): CC0 / ODC-ODbL per release terms.


Each restriction travels with its column and with any figure or table derived
from it. Redistribution of derived score columns follows the most restrictive
applicable upstream license, so a reuser with a commercial purpose must drop the
five non-commercial columns named above.
